# Lockfile is intentionally not committed — Cloudflare's `npm ci` chokes on
# cross-platform optional-dep drift (macOS lock resolves different transitive
# versions than the Linux build container). Without a lockfile Cloudflare
# runs `npm install`, which handles the platform differences correctly.
package-lock.json
